<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Landing page nao encontrada.">
  <title>Landing Page nao encontrada</title>
  <link href="/Assets/inspinia/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/Assets/inspinia/font-awesome/css/font-awesome.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: "Poppins", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 100%);
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .lp404 {
      width: min(100%, 720px);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .lp404-mark {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      color: #0f172a;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a7f3d0 0%, #7dd3fc 100%);
    }

    .lp404 h1 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    }

    .lp404 p {
      margin: 0 auto 10px;
      max-width: 520px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .lp404 code {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .lp404-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .lp404-actions .btn {
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="lp404">
    <div class="lp404-mark"><i class="fa fa-search"></i></div>
    <h1>Landing page nao encontrada</h1>
    <p>
      Nao achamos uma landing page publicada para este tenant. Se a URL foi enviada por alguem da equipe,
      vale revisar se a landing ja foi publicada nas configuracoes do tenant.
    </p>
    <% if (tenantRef) { %>
      <p><code><%= tenantRef %></code></p>
    <% } %>
    <div class="lp404-actions">
      <a href="/gecom" class="btn btn-primary">Ver landing da Gecom</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-default">Ir para login</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
